Azure Pipeline:
1. Build Pipelines: These pipeline Jobs clone the code from asiigned repositories and build the project based on instructions provided in yaml file. 
Typically we use Build pipelines to publish Artifacts of the project

2. Releasr Pipelines: These pipelines are generally used to deploy the build artifacts into Agent Machines.
3. Create Release: This component helps us to build ened to end pipeline (connecting Build and release Pipelines) for CI/CD implementation
